        "message": "Neale Donald Walsch's quotes emphasize concepts like the power of creation, the interconnectedness of all beings, the importance of living in the present, and the idea that fear and love are the two core motivations behind human actions. His work, particularly Conversations with God, encourages individuals to take responsibility for their lives by making conscious choices, seeking joy, and seeing themselves as creators of their reality. \n\n\"The deepest secret is that life is not a process of discovery, but a process of creation. You are not discovering yourself, but creating yourself anew. Seek therefore, not to find out Who You Are, but seek to determine Who You Want to Be\". \n~ Neale Donald Walsch. \n\n*This is the first time I have come across Neale D. Walsch. After a small deep dive into his work he has certainly peeked my interest. \n\nImage Quote Credit- Neale Donald Walsch./Pinterest. \nCosmic Spiritual Junkie. 💜",
        "message_rich": "Neale Donald Walsch's quotes emphasize concepts like the power of creation, the interconnectedness of all beings, the importance of living in the present, and the idea that fear and love are the two core motivations behind human actions. His work, particularly Conversations with God, encourages individuals to take responsibility for their lives by making conscious choices, seeking joy, and seeing themselves as creators of their reality. \n\n\"The deepest secret is that life is not a process of discovery, but a process of creation. You are not discovering yourself, but creating yourself anew. Seek therefore, not to find out Who You Are, but seek to determine Who You Want to Be\". \n~ Neale Donald Walsch. \n\n*This is the first time I have come across Neale D. Walsch. After a small deep dive into his work he has certainly peeked my interest. \n\nImage Quote Credit- Neale Donald Walsch./Pinterest. \nCosmic Spiritual Junkie. 💜",
